    The <code>[memory]</code> section configures lean-ctx's persistent memory subsystem. Memory is
    organized into specialized stores — each with its own retention policy, capacity limits, and
    retrieval rules. Use <code>memory_profile</code> for a preset, or fine-tune individual sub-tables.
  </p>

